[{"id":178920958,"discussion_id":"382b41f2a742d14c48ba36540bc168e83c975019","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 主要修复了 `aclnn_upsample_nearest_exact1d` 算子中 scale 计算不正确的问题。原先在调用底层 `l0op::ResizeNearestNeighborV2` 时，scales 参数直接传入了 `nullptr`，导致上采样缩放比例计算有误。本次变更在 `upsampleNearestExact1dCompute` 函数中新增 `originScales` 参数，构造包含 `{1, originScales}` 的缩放数组并传递给底层算子，从而修复 nearest exact 1d 上采样的缩放计算。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **函数签名扩展**: `upsampleNearestExact1dCompute` 新增 `float originScales` 参数，用于传递原始缩放比例。\n- **Scales 数组构造与传递**: 在 `IsRegBase()` 分支中，将原来传入 `ResizeNearestNeighborV2` 的 `nullptr` 替换为通过 `executor->AllocFloatArray` 构造的 `{1, originScales}` 数组 `scalesArray`，确保底层算子获得正确的缩放信息。\n- **调用点适配**: 在 `aclnnUpsampleNearestExact1dGetWorkspaceSize` 中新增 `originScales` 变量的计算（`scales > 0 ? static_cast<float>(scales) : 0`），并在调用 `upsampleNearestExact1dCompute` 时传入该值。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-07T16:34:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T17:29:55+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178920960,"discussion_id":"ad863016af2987e3085bbbd7578a180a7413c817","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n经过仔细审查，该 diff 的变更逻辑正确、自洽，未发现由本次变更引入的缺陷。以下是审查结论：\n\n## 审查总结\n\n**审查文件**: `image/upsample_nearest/op_host/op_api/aclnn_upsample_nearest_exact1d.cpp`（共 1 个变更文件）\n\n**审查结果**: 无问题。\n\n- `upsampleNearestExact1dCompute` 新增的 `originScales` 参数在 `IsRegBase()` 分支中正确构造 `scalesList{1, originScales}` 并传递给 `ResizeNearestNeighborV2`，取代了原先的 `nullptr`，修复了 Issue #601 描述的 scale 计算不正确的问题。\n- `originScales` 的计算逻辑 (`scales > 0 ? static_cast<float>(scales) : 0`) 与同仓库内 `aclnn_upsample_nearest_exact2d.cpp` 中 `IsRegBase()` 路径的处理模式一致。\n- 非 `IsRegBase()` 分支行为无变化，仍使用 `realScales`（倒数）调用 `UpsampleNearestExact2d`。\n- `vector<float> scalesList` 的生命周期覆盖了 `AllocFloatArray` 和 `ResizeNearestNeighborV2` 调用的完整作用域，无悬垂指针风险。\n- 公共 API 签名 (`aclnnUpsampleNearestExact1dGetWorkspaceSize` / `aclnnUpsampleNearestExact1d`) 未变更，无 ABI 兼容性问题。\n- `upsampleNearestExact1dCompute` 为 `static` 函数，仅在本文件内被一处调用，参数变更完整闭环。\n\n**整体风险判断**: 低风险。变更是针对性的 bug 修复，逻辑与同仓库 exact2d 算子一致，内部调用链完整闭环。\n\n> ⚠️ 已识别出整体风险，但无法提取行内评论，请参考整体评估。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-07T16:34:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T17:48:43+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178920984,"discussion_id":"bb440f093b4f5b338efaf31bb6893ee4a1ba4118","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| image/upsample_nearest | ✅ [*任如海*](https://gitcode.com/renruhai), [*查建青*](https://gitcode.com/zhajianqing123) (2/2) | ✅ [*任如海*](https://gitcode.com/renruhai), [*查建青*](https://gitcode.com/zhajianqing123) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n cuijie25, thanks for your pull reque